    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Refresh key reuse",
      "description": "A refresh key presented that was neither current nor inside the grace window. Refresh tokens rotate on every use, so this means the same token was spent twice: a replay, or a token that leaked. Anything above zero deserves a look.",
